summary: Shipped all 67 canonical agent archetypes as bundled .agent profiles, made the prompt assembler use each agent's rich description (not generic builder fallback), and added `paradigm agent sync-global` to materialize them into the global dir. Fixes the frozen-roster problem where a global npm update never expanded a user's available agents.
